Sentence|Translation
Jau vuleva ir a Giapun|I wanted to go to Japan
Ja na vuleva betg mangiar in tartuffel|I didn't want to eat a potato
Vulevan nus ir ordador?|Did we want to go outiside
Nus vulevan ina tomata|We wanted a tomato
Ti na vulevas betg vegnir ad ina furnaria|You didn't want to come to a bakery
Vulevas ti durmir da mesanotg?|Did you want to sleep at midnight?
Ti vulevas dastgar vegnir qua|You wanted to be allowed to come here
El vuleva far ina chasa|He wanted to make a house
Ella vuleva in persic e ina banana|She wanted a peach and a banana
El vuleva ir là però ella vuleva ir qua|He wanted to go there but she wanted to go here
Els vulevan durmir, però els eran en ina posta!|They wanted to sleep, but they were in a post office!
Vulevan els vegnir qua?|Did they want to come here?
Jau mangiava in'ampuauna oz|I ate a raspberry today
Mangiava jau mes frar?|Did I eat my brother?
Nus mangiavan cun mia tatta|We ate with my grandmother
Nus na mangiavan betg ina citrona|We didn't eat a lemon
Ti na mangiavas betg mes bab, ti mangiavas cun mes bab|You didn't eat my father, you ate with my father
Mangiavas ti charn-bov cun paiver nair?|Did you eat beef with black pepper?
Ti mangiavas poulet e schuppa senza pasta|You ate chicken and soup without pasta
El mangiava tschaina cun vin|He ate dinner with wine
El na mangiava betg in sandwich cun chaschiel e schambun|He didn't eat a sandwich with cheese and ham
Ella mangiava fava|She ate beans
Mangiava ella tost u in ov?|Did she eat toast or an egg
Els mangiavan in cornet delizius|They ate a delicious croissant
Mangiavan els canadels cun café u ina tschavera gustus cun ina tschigulatta chauda?|Did they eat knödeln with coffee or a tasty meal with hot chocolate?